// Kannada — Karnataka Textbook Society (KTBS), prescribed by KSEEB.
//
// Rewritten 2026-08-31. Everything below the "Retired" marker was synthetic:
// 81 topic labels ("ನಮ್ಮ ಶಾಲೆ", "ಅಮ್ಮ", "ಹಣ್ಣುಗಳು") that appear in no KTBS
// textbook. Not one overlapped a real chapter title. They are retired rather
// than deleted so any saved lesson plan that referenced one still resolves,
// but nothing should ever serve them again.
//
// Two things the old data got wrong beyond the titles:
//   - The book. Karnataka prescribes ಸವಿ ಕನ್ನಡ (Savi Kannada) for Classes 1-4
//     and ಸಿರಿ ಕನ್ನಡ (Siri Kannada) from Class 5. All ten grades said "Siri".
//   - The stream. KTBS publishes three Kannada readers per grade — ಸಿರಿ
//     (first language), ತಿಳಿ (second) and ನುಡಿ (third). These are the FIRST
//     LANGUAGE books; `languageStream: 'first'` says so. The second- and
//     third-language readers are not yet held. A Karnataka teacher of
//     second-language Kannada is therefore served nothing at this cell, which
//     is correct — better than being served the wrong book.
//
